+my_field : "d?c"   // Matches "doc" but not "disc"
 ----

 The `:` operator also supports wildcards in <<eql-syntax-lookup-operators,list
 lookups>>:

 [source,eql]
 ----
-field : ("f*o", "*bar", "baz*", "qux")
+my_field : ("doc*", "f*o", "ba?", "qux")
 ----

